Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:45:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Oracle: combat log and aggressive spawns (adapter 0.15.0)

combat_log start/stop writes one JSON line per resolved hit (attacker, victim,
part, damage, absorbed, weapons) and per down, wake, death and severed limb,
read from the display-only hit feed between ticks. setup_spawn_squad takes
aggro, which gives the squad the attack-enemies goal so fights run to the end.

